mlxflow 0.8
1. Read CSV         new_orders.csv
2. Store Write      orders.db; table=orders; key=id; mode=insert

3. Store Query      orders.db; table=orders; filter=status=pending
4. Query Table      filter=total>5000
5. Set Field        status=escalated
6. Store Write      orders.db; table=orders; key=id

7. Store Query      orders.db; table=orders; filter=status=pending
8. Set Field        status=approved
9. Store Write      orders.db; table=orders; key=id

10. Store Query     orders.db; table=orders; filter=status=escalated
11. Table to Text   format=markdown
12. Summarize       Qwen3 8B; "one line per order: why it needs a human
                    look before it ships"
13. Save Text       review-queue.md
